# The standalone mirror's own ignore rules (TabX's root .gitignore is not part of the
# subtree, so a clone of this repo would otherwise show installs and builds as untracked).

# Installs — the lockfiles ARE committed, on purpose: peer resolution rides them
# (memory/layout.md), so a clone runs `npm ci`, never a fresh resolve.
node_modules/

# Builds — the frontend's `vite build`; the backend emits nothing (`noEmit`), it is bundled
# by the deploy tooling.
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets — never committed (constitution, Article on secrets). Credentials reach a
# generated app by deploy-time env injection into the Lambda, not from this tree.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Test and tool output
coverage/
.vite/

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
*.log
